  "description": "FOFYEG crystallizes in the monoclinic crystal system with space group P 21/c. Reported CIF formula moiety: C64 H80 Gd6 N16 O28 2+,4(H2 O1),2(Cl1 1-). From the CIF bond table, Gd1 (Gd) has 7 O neighbors; Gd2 (Gd) has 7 O neighbors; Gd3 (Gd) has 7 O neighbors; Gd4 (Gd) has 7 O neighbors; Gd5 (Gd) has 7 O neighbors; Gd6 (Gd) has 7 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 9 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with approximately planar metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.737-3.910 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 102.11-111.05°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula [Gd6L^2_2(HCO2)4(μ3-OH)4(DMF)6(H2O)2](Cl)2·4H2O. Explicit grouped units in the article formula/name: 4 μ3-OH (explicit grouped unit in article formula), 2 H2O (explicit grouped unit in article formula), 4 μ3-OH (explicit grouped unit in article compound name (structural notation)), 2 H2O (explicit grouped unit in article compound name (structural notation)).",
